WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.589
Open Source Intelligence becomes useful when public information is collected and assessed through a disciplined workflow.

00:00:07.589 --> 00:00:13.877
Random searching may produce interesting links, but it rarely creates a defensible answer.

00:00:13.877 --> 00:00:20.599
A workflow connects the original question to sources, evidence, reasoning, and a decision-relevant result.

00:00:20.599 --> 00:00:22.984
Structure reduces wasted effort.

00:00:22.984 --> 00:00:31.007
Clear stages help analysts decide where to look, when to stop, and which material deserves deeper review.

00:00:31.007 --> 00:00:39.897
Without boundaries, collection can expand indefinitely while important sources, dates, and assumptions disappear into browser tabs and personal notes.

00:00:39.897 --> 00:00:42.715
A workflow also preserves evidence.

00:00:42.715 --> 00:00:48.570
URLs can change, pages can be updated, and search results can move.

00:00:48.570 --> 00:00:59.628
Recording source context, access time, relevant excerpts, and approved preservation artifacts allows another reviewer to understand what was available when a judgment was made.

00:00:59.628 --> 00:01:01.579
Repeatability improves quality.

00:01:01.579 --> 00:01:13.071
Another analyst may not reproduce an identical search ranking, but they should be able to follow the requirement, collection logic, source trail, and analytical reasoning.

00:01:13.071 --> 00:01:19.793
Review exposes unsupported leaps, duplicated claims, and missing alternatives before they shape a decision.

00:01:19.793 --> 00:01:22.612
Ethics belongs in every stage.

00:01:22.612 --> 00:01:29.334
Purpose, authority, privacy, proportionality, and access boundaries determine what should be collected and retained.

00:01:29.334 --> 00:01:35.188
Public visibility never authorizes harassment, doxxing, impersonation, access-control bypass, or unlawful surveillance.

00:01:35.188 --> 00:01:39.308
A mature workflow ends with reporting and feedback.

00:01:39.308 --> 00:01:46.463
The result should answer the requirement, explain confidence and limitations, and identify proportionate next steps.

00:01:46.463 --> 00:01:52.317
Feedback from the consumer then sharpens future questions, sources, methods, and reporting.
